      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>The character's senses are scrambled &mdash; she \"hears\" colors, \"tastes\" sounds, and the like &mdash; making everyday communication difficult (\"cut the sandpapery wire\" instead of \"cut the red wire\").</p><p><strong>Trigger/Effect:</strong> Two-Trait penalty to Expression/Performance challenges outside of surreal art; a Willpower Trait can be spent to translate sensory input into normal terms for a scene.</p><p><em>Source: Clanbook: Malkavian, New Derangements.</em></p>",
